                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30c33216-f51b-413d-b6b1-3a6f0336dc48",
                                "sense_id": "1d77c10e-c258-3594-821b-e05e1d0bdadb",
                                "text": "Под его́ нога́ми лежа́ли пове́рженные тела́ с однообра́зно раски́нутыми рука́ми — погляде́в на них, Тата́рский отме́тил несомне́нную связь ме́жду шуме́рским иску́сством и соцреали́змом.",
                                "translation": "Under his feet lay prostrate figures with their arms extended in identical gestures - looking at them, Tatarsky noted the quite definite kinship between Sumerian art and socialist realism.",
                                "english": "Under his feet lay prostrate figures with their arms extended in identical gestures - looking at them, Tatarsky noted the quite definite kinship between Sumerian art and socialist realism."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
